      "writtenOn": "2024-05-22T10:11:32Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "The consideration here, which I am also rather unsure about, is whether we can have some level of assurance that the path back (meaning host-\u003eguest) will be okay since we still seem to be using android formats on the way in, I believe.",
